@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 0. 관리자 로그인
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@shoplab.com", "password": "Admin1234!" }

### 1. 요약
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. 일별 매출 (기본: 최근 14일)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dashboard/daily-sales
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. 일별 매출 (기간 지정)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dashboard/daily-sales?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-11-10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. 기간 92일 초과 → 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dashboard/daily-sales?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-11-10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. 판매 순위 (최근 14일, 상위 5개)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dashboard/top-products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. 판매 순위 (상위 3개, 기간 지정)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dashboard/top-products?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-11-10&limit=3
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. limit 범위 밖 → 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dashboard/top-products?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}